    "title": "Sparks police conducting distracted driving enforcement - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kevin Sheridan ,\n6 hours ago SPARKS, Nev. (KOLO) - The Sparks Police Department will be conducting a distracted driving enforcement operation. The Joining Forces Distracted Driving campaign will take place from this Friday Aug. 31. The campaign aims to increase law enforcement participation by coordinating highly visible patrols around Sparks and the state of Nevada. Read full article\n1",
